ay">7</span>\n <p class="bookname">重生之文豪崛起</p>\n <p class="author">汪公子在年</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/364.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">8</span>\n <p class="bookname">我姓王，我的邻居武大郎</p>\n <p class="author">格鱼</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/5357.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">9</span>\n <p class="bookname">神秘复苏</p>\n <p class="author">佛前献花</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1428.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">10</span>\n <p class="bookname">韩先生情谋已久</p>\n <p class="author">恍若晨曦</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/548.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">11</span>\n <p class="bookname">盗墓：从七星鲁王宫开始</p>\n <p class="author">屋漏偏逢</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/256.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">12</span>\n <p class="bookname">这个大夫画风清奇却举世无敌</p>\n <p class="author">辰时岁月</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/93531.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">13</span>\n <p class="bookname">恶雌娇软：深陷五个兽夫修罗场</p>\n <p class="author">莲子呢</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/901.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">14</span>\n <p class="bookname">天选神妃</p>\n <p class="author">花萌种子</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n <ul class="vlist">\n <li><a href="/shu/1374.html"><span\n class="layui-badge layui-bg-gray">15</span>\n <p class="bookname">仙子你道侣又换人设了</p>\n <p class="author">神棍</p></a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n</div>\n<form action="/search.html" method="post" class="search">\n\t\t<span><i class="layui-icon i_search"></i><i class="layui-icon i_cancel"></i><input type="text" name="searchkey" placeholder="请输入搜索内容！" /></span>\n\t\t<button class="layui-btn">搜索</button>\n\t</form>\n<div class="footer">\n<p><a href="/shuku/">书库</a> <a href="/sort.html">分类</a> <a href="/zuozhe/">作者</a> <a href="/wanben/">全本</a> <a href="/top/"